Package: readfiscalnz
Title: Reproducible Access to New Zealand Treasury Fiscal Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro",
           email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Retrieves, validates, normalises, and replays byte-pinned releases
    of official New Zealand Treasury fiscal data. Readers cover Historical
    Fiscal Indicators, tax outturns, monthly financial statements, and
    Economic and Fiscal Updates. Returned long-form data retain accounting
    regimes, consolidation scope, forecast vintages, source status, exact
    input hashes, and parser and schema provenance. Local files enable
    deterministic offline workflows.
